title V2 - Grounding guardrails
direction right
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow

Postgres pgvector [shape: cylinder, icon: database, color: blue]

Query path [color: purple] {
  User [icon: user]
  Query embedder [icon: cpu]
  Top-6 cosine search [icon: search]
  Relevance gate [shape: diamond, icon: filter, color: orange]
  Refuse without LLM [icon: x-octagon, color: red]
  Strict prompt temp 0 [icon: file-text]
  LLM qwen3-4b-instruct [icon: message-circle]
}

Checks [color: orange] {
  Citation check [icon: check-square]
  Optional LLM fact check [icon: shield]
  Warnings shown to user [icon: alert-triangle]
}

Evaluation [color: gray] {
  Eval set facts images traps [icon: clipboard]
}

User > Query embedder: question
Query embedder > Top-6 cosine search
Top-6 cosine search <> Postgres pgvector
Top-6 cosine search > Relevance gate
Relevance gate > Refuse without LLM: best score below 0.68
Relevance gate > Strict prompt temp 0: relevant
Strict prompt temp 0 > LLM qwen3-4b-instruct
LLM qwen3-4b-instruct > Citation check: answer
Citation check > Optional LLM fact check: verify flag
Optional LLM fact check > Warnings shown to user
Citation check > User: answer + sources
Eval set facts images traps > Relevance gate: calibrates threshold
